{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:2f2d605642f3599b","name":"4th-Degree Droid Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-2f2d605642f3599b","title":"4th-Degree Droid Talent Tree","revision":26315,"timestamp":"2025-03-18T17:28:50Z","sha256":"3f6d4abbb3a12382a884855bb140986685bf382b769ff93d5d1169d498f64546","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26315","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=4th-Degree%20Droid%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-2f2d605642f3599b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["4th-Degree Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/4th-Degree_Droids","referenceId":"reference:e0ba1be2d9a6a37a"}," are Battle Droids, Destroyer Droids, Security Droids, War Droids, Probe Droids, and Assassin Droids. Only they can select Talents from this Droid Talent Tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Combat Repairs"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per day, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", you can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," skill to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repair"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repair"}," yourself, as opposed to the normal 1 hour.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Droid Smash"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can use your mechanical strength when wielding a melee weapon. You add 2 x your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," bonus to melee damage rolls when wielding a weapon in one hand.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Targeting Package"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can take two consecutive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," in the same round to activate special targeting software. When you do so, you gain a +2 bonus on attack rolls and damage rolls on your next attack if your target is at Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," (or within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"}," for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:dbacc8ccae71d4dc"},") and within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". You lose the benefit of this Talent if you lose ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to your target or if you take any other action before making your attack. The effect of this Talent stacks with that of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Point-Blank Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Point-Blank_Shot","referenceId":"reference:7464dcbe8125c639"}," feat.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Just a Scratch"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," Equipped with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medium Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medium_Armor","referenceId":"reference:e2a45d7d144d40dd"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4bc2d20a5687b54f"},", Proficient with Armor equipped\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", you can reduce the damage from a single attack that targets your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," by an amount equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Target Acquisition"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", designate an enemy target within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," as an acquired target. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls for all attacks against that target until the end of the encounter, as long as the target remains within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Targeted Lock"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Target Lock in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Target Lock"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Target_Lock","referenceId":"reference:ac59d88c386d66a0"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Target Acquisition"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You lock onto the target designated by the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Target Acquisition"]}," Talent. If the target leaves your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},", you automatically reacquire the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Target Lock"]}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," if the target comes back within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". You also gain a +5 bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," skill when opposing the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Weapons Power Surge"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," Equipped with a Weapon ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tool Mount"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tool_Mount","referenceId":"reference:45d4e22b431825b6"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},", you can increase the damage dealt by one of your weapons by 1 or 2 damage dice in exchange for moving -1 step down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," for each die increased. The weapon must be permanently mounted to your chassis (as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tool Mount"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tool_Mount","referenceId":"reference:45d4e22b431825b6"},"), and it must use your internal power supply. Handheld weapons, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Rifles"},", do not qualify for this Talent.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
